===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|court-martial}}

===Etymology===
A calque translation of {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|cour}} {{m|fr|martiale}}, hence the unusual order of adjective following noun.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|courts martial}}

# A [[court]] where cases of [[military]] [[law]] are heard.

